    "subtitle": "EOF Notification No.: 33036 /19.03.2025",
    "description": "EOF Notification No.: 33036 /19.03.2025 SOLGAR Magnesium Citrate Powder is a dietary supplement with Magnesium Citrate powder. This is a highly absorbable magnesium supplement, as the citrate form is a bioavailable form of magnesium, and is highly absorbable compared to other forms of magnesium. Furthermore, it is available in powder form & the packaging comes with a scoop, making magnesium consumption easier & more enjoyable. Magnesium is a vital mineral, as it is involved in many functions in the body. Therefore, adequate magnesium intake by consuming magnesium-rich foods, such as leafy green vegetables, nuts and seeds, and supplementing the diet with a magnesium supplement such as SOLGAR Magnesium Citrate Powder, is important to support overall health & well-being. More specifically, magnesium helps in: • Normal function of metabolic processes aimed at energy production • Reduction of the feeling of tiredness & fatigue • Support of daily vitality • Normal muscle function • Normal function of the nervous system • Normal psychological function • Maintenance of healthy bones • Electrolyte balance • Normal protein synthesis Magnesium has properties that make it ideal for people who: • Have an active lifestyle & seek energy • Athletes & exercisers • Want to support their muscle & bone health • Want to support their mental balance Magnesium Citrate Powder: Citrate form, ideal for people who cannot easily absorb other forms of minerals, combined with the powder form, ideal for those who have difficulty swallowing capsules. Suitable for vegans.",
