      "Περιγραφή": "EOF Notification No.: 33036 /19.03.2025\n\nSOLGAR Magnesium Citrate Powder is a dietary supplement with Magnesium Citrate powder.\n\nThis is a highly absorbable magnesium supplement, as the citrate form is a bioavailable form of magnesium, and is highly absorbable compared to other forms of magnesium. Furthermore, it is available in powder form & the packaging comes with a scoop, making magnesium consumption easier & more enjoyable.\n\nMagnesium is a vital mineral, as it is involved in many functions in the body. Therefore, adequate magnesium intake by consuming magnesium-rich foods, such as leafy green vegetables, nuts and seeds, and supplementing the diet with a magnesium supplement such as SOLGAR Magnesium Citrate Powder, is important to support overall health & well-being.\n\nMore specifically, magnesium helps in: \n• Normal function of metabolic processes aimed at energy production \n• Reduction of the feeling of tiredness & fatigue \n• Support of daily vitality \n• Normal muscle function \n• Normal function of the nervous system \n• Normal psychological function \n• Maintenance of healthy bones \n• Electrolyte balance \n• Normal protein synthesis\n\nMagnesium has properties that make it ideal for people who: \n• Have an active lifestyle & seek energy \n• Athletes & exercisers \n• Want to support their muscle & bone health \n• Want to support their mental balance\n\nMagnesium Citrate Powder: Citrate form, ideal for people who cannot easily absorb other forms of minerals, combined with the powder form, ideal for those who have difficulty swallowing capsules.\n\nSuitable for vegans.",
